        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "6bd3a868-99dd-535a-95b9-61a8238992d6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Shayang County, Mengzhou, Maliang Town, Jingmen City, Hubei Province, Henan Province, Kaifeng, Jiaozuo\n- People: Liu Xiwu, Wen Ding, Quan Wending\n- Historical States: Quan, Chu\n\nFacts:\n- Quan Wending, a son of Wen Ding, founded the state of Quan in the area of modern Maliang Town in Shayang County, Jingmen City, Hubei Province, beside the area where the state of Chu later emerged.\n- Shayang County is a county in west-central Hubei Province, People's Republic of China.\n- Mengzhou is a county-level city in Henan Province, People's Republic of China.\n- Liu Xiwu was born in Meng County, Henan Province, which is modern Mengzhou in Jiaozuo, Henan Province.\n- Liu Xiwu was educated in Kaifeng.",
